{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124328","id":4801442627,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHjAzQw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124328","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124328.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124328.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124328","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124328/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124328/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124328/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1b1d5151211e015691b9a6400af6ff7d2dbf3ecf","number":124328,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Prevent project title label from going behind main dock tab bar.","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n<img width=\"1070\" height=\"43\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-10-09 à 15 52 38\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53fc1cc4-af9f-442f-a7e3-c553751999ce\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nDeepending on the size of the name of scene and project currently opened the title can go behind the main dock tab bar. This is because the main dock tab bar can now be bigger then its minimum size. Which makes it harder to know where the label can go as a spacer. \r\nMost likely a regression from #113051 but haven't really tested. Not reproducable in 4.7\r\n\r\nTo fix it I made it so the spacer is separate from the label which is not optimal as this means it will be cut off before the main bar but I don't currently see a way to have the optimal size for the main dock tabbar to cut of the label at this position. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1499\" height=\"40\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-10-09 à 15 36 00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a66c082-0f61-4b83-a156-690a081b0676\" />\r\n\r\nEdit : it now acts exactly as it was working in 4.7\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23f564f7-e415-4698-ab85-90ba3cbcd68e\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":""